OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,4,F
OL,5, The British Government has announced an
OL,6, emergency package of up to #1 million
OL,7, for the Caribbean islands devastated by
OL,8, Hurricane Hugo.
OL,10,FThe hurricane, which is said to have
OL,11,Fkilled at least 20 people, is now
OL,12,Fheading for the Bahamas and Florida.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FAt least six were killed on the island
OL,15,Fof Montserrat where almost the entire
OL,16,Fpopulation was left homeless. Royal
OL,17,FNavy personnel have been helping to
OL,18,Frestore power and clear the airstrip.
OL,19,F
OL,20,FRAF cargo planes are being sent with
OL,21,Fsupplies for the Caribbean islands.
OL,22,F
OL,23,T]CFrom 19-09-89   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
