OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G9/10
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, The hijack has ended of a Moroccan
OL,6, passenger plane by a gunman who forced
OL,7, the aircraft to land on Spain's Gran
OL,8, Canary island.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FThe small plane, owned by Royal Air
OL,11,FMaroc, was on an internal flight in the
OL,12,Fwestern Sahara with six passengers and
OL,13,Ftwo crew aboard.
OL,15,FThe hijacker, who was armed with a sub-
OL,16,Fmachine gun, gave himself up after four
OL,17,Fand a half hours on the ground.
OL,19,FThe hijack came less than a week before
OL,20,FKing Hassan of Morocco begins his first
OL,21,Fstate visit to Spain next Monday.
OL,23,T]CFrom 19-09-89   teletextarchive.com
