OL,2,Q]Su5<55 555jjjjz V]D
OL,3,Q]S,%#!#!!!#"""(. V]D CUP VICTORY FOR
OL,4,V ||||||||||||||||] D SAN DIEGO
OL,5,F
OL,6,FThe 1988CAmerica's Cup,Foriginally
OL,7,Fawarded to New Zealand, has been given
OL,8,Fto America after a two year court row.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FStars and Stripes 2, a catamaran, won a
OL,11,Ffarcical mis-match with the New Zealand
OL,12,Fmaxi yacht, but was successfully
OL,13,Fchallenged in court.
OL,14,F
OL,15,FBut the New York Appeals Court has
OL,16,Freversed the lower court decision and
OL,17,Fdeclared the San Diego Yacht Club
OL,18,Fwinners over Kiwis Mercury Bay.
OL,20,FStars and Stripes skipper Dennis Conner
OL,21,Fsaid he hoped New Zealand syndicate
OL,22,Fleader Michael Fay would not appeal
OL,23,Fagainst the ruling.  A]CFrom 19-09-89
